a PDB write with One UI's FRP active fails as an I/O error, scripts/patch-built-jar.sh), 2026-11-13. 0.5.01 r20: r19 with framework_patched.jar patched by patches/guest_secims_ready.py (Samsung IMS hears telephony is ready for a call's callbacks: calls end, scripts/patch-built-jar.sh), 2026-11-13.
